From: Zhiyi Zhang <zzhang@codeweavers.com>
Subject: Experimental ALPC connection and message backport to Wine 10.20

Source: https://gitlab.winehq.org/zhiyi/wine/tree/bug-23698-react-native-alpc
Revision: 5505b7de0ea3f76dedaa19728f3d0581dc28d35f
Selected ALPC files only. Not merged/released upstream and not enabled in launchers.
Local changes: retain all stock server request IDs, explicit request-data object
attribute decoder, reject invalid creation attributes before sending the request.
Known draft limitations include token/sequence placeholders and unchecked message
sizes; isolated research build only, not a claim of complete Windows semantics.
Apply after patches 0003 and 0004; regenerate tools/make_requests and tools/make_specfiles.

